mme requirements, organise Infostud and Universitaly steps, and compare Lazio DiSCo with university funding.\",\"image\":\"https://aspirecompass.org/images/expansion-20261022/italy-sapienza-1280.webp\",\"datePublished\":\"2026-10-22\",\"dateModified\":\"2026-10-22\",\"author\":{\"@type\":\"Organization\",\"name\":\"AspireCompass Editorial Team\",\"url\":\"https://aspirecompass.org/editorial-policy/\"},\"publisher\":{\"@type\":\"Organization\",\"name\":\"AspireCompass\",\"logo\":{\"@type\":\"ImageObject\",\"url\":\"https://aspirecompass.org/logo.svg\"}},\"mainEntityOfPage\":\"https://aspirecompass.org/guides/sapienza-university-admissions-scholarships/\"}"}}],["$","script","3",{"type":"application/ld+json","dangerouslySetInnerHTML":{"__html":"{\"@context\":\"https://schema.org\",\"@type\":\"FAQPage\",\"mainEntity\":[{\"@type\":\"Question\",\"name\":\"Is Sapienza admission the same as a scholarship?\",\"acceptedAnswer\":{\"@type\":\"Answer\",\"text\":\"No. An offer establishes academic admission subject to its conditions. Regional and university funding have separate rules and procedures.\"}},{\"@type\":\"Question\",\"name\":\"Does an English-taught programme accept any English certificate?\",\"acceptedAnswer\":{\"@type\":\"Answer\",\"text\":\"No. Check the exact course call for accepted evidence and exemptions.\"}},{\"@type\":\"Question\",\"name\":\"Does Universitaly validation guarantee a visa?\",\"acceptedAnswer\":{\"@type\":\"Answer\",\"text\":\"No. Visa assessment belongs to the relevant diplomatic mission; university validation does not guarantee it.\"}}]}"}}]],"$L19",false,"$L1a","$L1b"]}]
